          "dateUpdated": "2026-02-24T00:56:44.242Z"
        },
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40, in `ReadSFWImage()` (`coders/sfw.c`), when temporary file creation fails, `read_info` is destroyed before its `filename` member is accessed, causing a NULL pointer dereference and crash. Versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40 contain a patch."
          }
        ],
        "source": {
          "advisory": "GHSA-p33r-fqw2-rqmm",
